@startuml getLocalId
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
getLocalId – Retrieve localId of fc-port by LTP UUID
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "FcPort " as fcPortRes #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json " as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
  - forwardingConstruct 
  - ltpUuid
end note

requestor -> fcPortRes: (forwardingConstruct, ltpUuid)
activate fcPortRes

fcPortRes -> jd: read ForwardingConstruct
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve Complete LTP
jd --> fcPortRes: fc-port list
deactivate jd

note over fcPortRes
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Iterate through fc-port entries in forwardingConstruct  
  - Check if fc-port's logical-termination-point matches ltpUuid  
  - Return localId of matching fc-port  
  - Return undefined if no match exists
end note

fcPortRes --> requestor: localId | undefined
deactivate fcPortRes

@enduml
